Task-adapter harness for the Kaggle "Google Quantum AI - Verifiable Quantum
Circuit Compilation" competition.

This distribution contains:

- Original harness code (scripts/, tasks/, configs/): Apache-2.0.
- Dream-RSI, fetched at its pinned revision by scripts/bootstrap.sh and left
  unmodified: Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0
  (https://github.com/google-research/dream-rsi).
- kickmix, fetched from Qualtran at the pinned revision by scripts/bootstrap.sh:
  Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0
  (https://github.com/quantumlib/Qualtran).
- Competition verifiers and reference circuits, downloaded by
  scripts/fetch_data.sh from the Kaggle competition dataset; use is subject to
  the competition rules
  (https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/google-verifiable-quantum-circuit-compilation/rules).
- The DREAM-RSI engine and the verification-based evaluation protocol are
  described in arXiv:2609.14858 (Dream-RSI) and arXiv:2610.23832 (verifiable
  quantum circuit compilation).
